{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提多書","commonName":"提多書","title":"提多書","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"bbabddaa86a99d07bc8e1504469077e53d4f658ff0ef5ae59a29a031e6c87162","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["純正的道理"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但你所講的總要合乎那純正的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["勸老年人要有節制、端莊、自守，在信心、愛心、忍耐上都要純全無疵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又勸老年婦人，舉止行動要恭敬，不說讒言，不給酒作奴僕，用善道教訓人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["好指教少年婦人，愛丈夫，愛兒女，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["謹守，貞潔，料理家務，待人有恩，順服自己的丈夫，免得上帝的道理被毀謗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又勸少年人要謹守。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己凡事要顯出善行的榜樣；在教訓上要正直、端莊，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["言語純全，無可指責，叫那反對的人，既無處可說我們的不是，便自覺羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["勸僕人要順服自己的主人，凡事討他的喜歡，不可頂撞他，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可私拿東西，要顯為忠誠，以致凡事尊榮我們救主－上帝的道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為上帝救眾人的恩典已經顯明出來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["教訓我們除去不敬虔的心和世俗的情慾，在今世自守、公義、敬虔度日，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["等候所盼望的福，並等候至大的上帝和我們",{"noteId":0},"救主耶穌基督的榮耀顯現。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他為我們捨了自己，要贖我們脫離一切罪惡，又潔淨我們，特作自己的子民，熱心為善。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這些事你要講明，勸戒人，用各等權柄責備人；不可叫人輕看你。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：上帝－我們","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}